<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-10-21 | Day 175: Scheduled Tasks - Making Automation Real" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 175. Created Windows scheduled tasks to make the automation system truly operational. But scheduled tasks are just the beginning, not the end." navActive="diary" lang="en">
